// Pull request: #6500 new: Contagious Interview (DPRK) EtherHiding Chain - Emerging Threat And Hunting Rules
// Pull request URL: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/pull/6500
// Pull request author: popkir
// Change: new rule
// Title: Contagious Interview Loader Artefacts Or Persistence Created - MacOS
// Sigma ID: edb79bb9-c386-4905-8a4e-c0b23cee9b81
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Kirill Popov
// Date: 2026-10-21 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, T1059.007, persistence, privilege-escalation, T1543.001
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects creation of the loader and implant working files that a DPRK "Contagious Interview"
//   dropper chain writes into "~/.vs_cache/", and of the LaunchAgent the stage-3 implant uses for
//   persistence (com.AppleAccountSync.plist) or for its temporary headless-browser cookie dump
//   (com.vs.hc.*).
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/dprk-adopts-etherhiding
//   - https://www.ic3.gov/CSA/2026/260918.pdf
//   - https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/677b85d56283a7c22f7f32350c6d81a7873c6c6afe1ff6b0d5a9608ba9614068
//   - https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/761e0adb34e6f89ba43fcd65cf861593bfee9319e38e6175394921309e83a254
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/fa23002b3c18ef5eb6ee47ceedde81228ebef016/rules-emerging-threats/2026/TA/Contagious-Interview/file_event_macos_mal_contagious_interview_vs_cache_artefacts.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceFileEvents
| where (FolderPath contains "/.vs_cache/" and (FolderPath endswith "/main.js" or FolderPath endswith "/key-agent.js" or FolderPath endswith "/vs.sid" or FolderPath endswith "/mmc.pid" or FolderPath endswith "/mmc.log" or FolderPath endswith "/log.log")) or (FolderPath contains "/Library/LaunchAgents/" and (FolderPath endswith "/com.AppleAccountSync.plist" or FolderPath endswith "/com.vs.hc.chrome.plist" or FolderPath endswith "/com.vs.hc.brave.plist"))
